REGISTER  WORLD II  --  THE FOLD   (live)
==============================================================================================================

  appeals 8   domains 64   seats 2048   seated 1469   pages on disk 1475
  house-form spheres 1352   other-form pages 56   unmeasured 45   broken 22

THE SCORE, out of 100. Every term is read off the running page:

   40   exposes a live window.__ handle          (it can be checked at all)
   20   that handle asserts ok and passes        (it checks itself)
   20   share of its published LIT numbers that reproduce against live values
   10   interactive controls, capped at four     (you can drive it)
    5   the five-window house form
    5   carries an AVAN inverse

  UNMEASURED means the page died on a DOM, WebGL or crypto facility the offline
  harness does not implement. That is a limit of the harness. Those pages are
  listed separately and given no score rather than a zero they did not earn.

